    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        241,
        1526,
        1545,
        1637
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the development of an integrated approach to the problem of domestic violence and the coordination of existing systems and services are critical to the success of the City's efforts in this area;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
